    "https://alfie-project.eu/etd-hub#contextText": [
      {
        "@value": "Automation bias - how to avoid a situation in which recruiters over-rely on the outputs of such systems? How do we ensure that their autonomy to make decisions is not affected? \r\n\r\nFor example the Assessment List for Trustworthy AI asks \"Could the AI system affect human autonomy by generating over-reliance by end-users?\" ? \r\n\r\nHow do we make sure that the decision made by the system are understandable and explainable to the applicants and recruiters?"
      }
    ],
    "https://alfie-project.eu/etd-hub#context_source": [
